---
// Testimonials section component
// Displays social proof from successful producers
---

<section id="testimonials" class="w-full bg-white scroll-mt-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
	<div class="section-inner flex flex-col gap-4">
		<div class="text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
			<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900">
				Producers Like You Are Already Winning
			</h2>
			<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl self-center">
				Here's the kind of paper they're writing with the same leads we're sending. You could be next.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
			<div class="testimonial-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center mb-6">
					<div class="text-yellow-500 text-xl">★★★★★</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
					"Closed a $150K deal, nobody commissions, so around 5.7%. That's roughly $7,500 to $10,000 from one deal alone. And they just get bigger and bigger."
				</p>
				<div class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold text-base">Michael, Independent Producer</div>
			</div>

			<div class="testimonial-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center mb-6">
					<div class="text-yellow-500 text-xl">★★★★★</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
					"$200K deal. That's $10K to $14K in commission. The prospects have the assets and they're ready to have the conversation. Makes all the difference."
				</p>
				<div class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold text-base">Dwayne, Producer</div>
			</div>

			<div class="testimonial-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center mb-6">
					<div class="text-yellow-500 text-xl">★★★★★</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
					"Wrapped up an $800K deal. $40K to $56K in commissions. Absolutely monster. When the prospects are qualified and have rollover-ready assets, the opportunities are real."
				</p>
				<div class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold text-base">Tom, Producer</div>
			</div>

			<div class="testimonial-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center mb-6">
					<div class="text-yellow-500 text-xl">★★★★★</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
					"In first two leads, booked appointments and both were fully intent on buying. With minimal effort, they both instantly approved and made significant purchases. The suitability process was smooth."
				</p>
				<div class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold text-base">Brent Lucas, Wealth Manager</div>
			</div>

			<div class="testimonial-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center mb-6">
					<div class="text-yellow-500 text-xl">★★★★★</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
					"Easiest appointments I've ever run. They're asking about FIAs before I even pitch them. When they've got the assets and they're in the retirement window, it's a different game."
				</p>
				<div class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold text-base">Mike H., Retirement Income Specialist</div>
			</div>

			<div class="testimonial-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center mb-6">
					<div class="text-yellow-500 text-xl">★★★★★</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
					"Just took an application on my first appointment. The prospect was pre-qualified and ready to roll over their 401(k). No chasing. They had the assets and were ready to move."
				</p>
				<div class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold text-base">Todd S., Financial Advisor</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

